title: "Boogie-Woogie Music Generation"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
url: "https://github.com/abrahambenveniste/boogie-woogie-musicgen"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Boogie-Woogie music project with prompt-conditioned Meta
  MusicGen audio inference and a custom PyTorch character LSTM trained from
  MIDI. It documents source data, preprocessing, model settings, and outputs.
